WEBVTT

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:41.260
The former BBA team has been
approached by Ozma and his group.

00:01:41.260 --> 00:01:45.710
They challenged them in order to try and bait out their Sacred Beasts.

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:52.090
Takao, Rei, and Max all suffered losses,

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:56.630
and this group disappeared without a trace.

00:02:03.350 --> 00:02:08.770
Another member of this mysterious
group appeared before Kai.

00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:19.490
Just one match.

00:02:19.490 --> 00:02:21.620
Yeah. That's all I want.

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:23.160
Go Shoot!

00:03:00.240 --> 00:03:02.200
The match was a draw.

00:03:04.030 --> 00:03:06.580
But at the same time,

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:10.250
another group, independent
of these mysterious kids,

00:03:10.250 --> 00:03:14.090
have their sights set on the
BBA team's Sacred Beasts.

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:39.860
Rotation rate set to 450.

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:43.280
Center alignment set to 98%.

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:45.870
Oscillation coefficient set to 3.4.

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:47.370
Starting now.

00:03:58.090 --> 00:04:00.800
Rotation rate, center alignment.

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:02.550
Oscillation coefficient.

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:04.720
All settings have been approved.

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:36.250
This is the Blader Development Room

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:40.130
which was made by Mr. Gideon to raise the ultimate Bladers.

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:43.380
The Bladers follow their own

00:04:43.380 --> 00:04:47.510
individual training regimens
as is ascribed to them

00:04:47.510 --> 00:04:49.890
by inputting data into a computer program.

00:04:52.230 --> 00:04:53.940
Go Shoot!

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:05.280
--Go Shoot!

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:10.030
Go! Go!

00:05:10.030 --> 00:05:11.370
You can't beat me!

00:05:12.370 --> 00:05:13.910
Do it! Now!

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:04.010
He just sliced that iron
plate clean in half!

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:09.840
Magtram?

00:06:10.510 --> 00:06:14.060
It's a special part developed
by our organization.

00:06:18.440 --> 00:06:20.150
Once set into a Bey,

00:06:21.190 --> 00:06:26.820
it gives off a special magnetic
field when spun at high speeds.

00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:29.700
That magnetic field reduces air drag,

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:33.080
so the Bey's every movement
is under your control!

00:06:33.080 --> 00:06:36.000
You can move it in
any way you like.

00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:39.670
This is all assuming that you can

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:41.420
master the Magtram or not.

00:06:42.960 --> 00:06:44.880
Do you want to give it a go, Snake?

00:06:44.880 --> 00:06:47.550
If you put the Magtram in your Bey,

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:50.050
Takao Kinomiya's Dragoon, well,

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:51.180
it won't stand a chance.

00:06:52.930 --> 00:06:55.180
D'ya mind if I rip it to shreds?

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:56.720
Oh?

00:06:57.770 --> 00:06:58.980
Dragoon, I mean.

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:03.110
I wanna know if I can tear it to
bits until there's nothing left!

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:05.270
Absolutely.

00:07:05.270 --> 00:07:07.150
Rip it into as many shreds as you please.

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:15.370
Time for us to finish this, Ozma!

00:07:16.830 --> 00:07:18.870
I won't lose this time!

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:21.330
I'll show you the power
of my Sacred Beast!

00:07:22.250 --> 00:07:24.380
Come on! Get ready!

00:07:25.750 --> 00:07:27.000
Now!

00:07:30.300 --> 00:07:33.220
Are you ready or not?!

00:07:40.770 --> 00:07:41.770
Oh, it was a dream.

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:44.110
Ms. Keiko!

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:46.650
Dang it...

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:51.320
Now I gotta scrub the bathrooms?
You're not getting away with this, Hiromi!

00:07:51.780 --> 00:07:54.990
So they didn't leave any clues?

00:07:55.210 --> 00:07:57.830
I tried looking into it
as much as I could.

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:01.160
I knew it. This incident...

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:04.330
Is the work of an international crime ring!

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:05.250
Huh?

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:06.670
How stupid are you?

00:08:06.670 --> 00:08:09.380
International crime ring my foot!

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:10.420
What was that?

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:12.970
Nothin'!

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:18.180
Leaving no traces of that huge
robot was clever of them...

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:19.540
I'm positive!

00:08:19.540 --> 00:08:22.940
Their evil plan must be
to take over the world!

00:08:23.130 --> 00:08:24.850
Take over the world?

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:26.730
Yup. With those whatchamacallits...

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:28.110
Sacred Beasts?

00:08:28.110 --> 00:08:30.610
Yeah. Using those Sacred thingies,

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:34.740
they're gonna destroy the
world and rule over a new one!

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:37.350
A world of machines, ruled by science!

00:08:37.350 --> 00:08:39.870
Humanity will be enslaved by machines,

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:42.960
unable to experience
romance or fall in love!

00:08:43.660 --> 00:08:46.960
This has turned into
some amazing story.

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:48.500
What do you think?

00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:49.430
Huh?

00:08:49.430 --> 00:08:50.590
About what?

00:08:50.590 --> 00:08:53.590
About, uh, you know, the robo-Blader--

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:54.680
Oh, that thing?

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:57.180
What's with the carefree attitude?

00:08:57.180 --> 00:08:59.140
The future of mankind is at stake!

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:01.970
I don't really care, so I'm goin' this way.

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:04.420
Oh? Aren't we going together?

00:09:04.420 --> 00:09:05.980
Where?

00:09:05.980 --> 00:09:07.870
Isn't it obvious?

00:09:07.870 --> 00:09:08.940
The harbor!

00:09:09.160 --> 00:09:11.190
Always return to the scene of the crime!

00:09:11.190 --> 00:09:13.190
That's detective work 101!

00:09:13.190 --> 00:09:16.280
You don't listen at all do you?

00:09:16.280 --> 00:09:17.950
Whatever. Either way,

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:20.660
I'll leave them to you. Good luck!

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:21.540
See ya!

00:09:21.540 --> 00:09:22.500
Takao!

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:24.790
Just let him go.

00:09:24.790 --> 00:09:26.500
Let's get moving!

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:29.000
Yes!

00:10:18.760 --> 00:10:21.100
This isn't over!

00:10:24.430 --> 00:10:28.230
Damn! Where'd that big jerk go?!

00:10:41.990 --> 00:10:46.870
Takao's been real out of it these days.

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:51.040
I'll give him a good whack.

00:10:52.000 --> 00:10:53.710
Your guard is down!

00:10:58.590 --> 00:11:01.390
What in the world did I just see?

00:11:01.390 --> 00:11:03.350
To think he'd actually study!

00:11:03.350 --> 00:11:04.640
No, it couldn't be.

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:12.020
This is an emergency! Call 911!

00:11:12.020 --> 00:11:12.940
Grandpa!

00:11:14.270 --> 00:11:17.230
Keep it down, will ya? I can't concentrate!

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:18.530
Honestly...

00:11:19.110 --> 00:11:20.860
Yes, dearest apologies...

00:11:22.320 --> 00:11:24.490
Okay! Let's do it!

00:11:51.940 --> 00:11:53.100
Shoot!

00:12:20.010 --> 00:12:22.880
Is it to your liking, Mr. Gideon?

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:29.400
He certainly has mastered the
Magtram in such a short time.

00:12:29.400 --> 00:12:32.350
I expect great things from you, Snake.

00:12:47.530 --> 00:12:48.870
I'm off!

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:53.080
Just you wait, Ozma!

00:12:53.080 --> 00:12:55.710
I'm gonna find you!

00:12:56.380 --> 00:12:58.000
How weird...

00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:00.630
This is a good time to make a move, too.

00:13:00.630 --> 00:13:04.680
Come on, Hiromi, let me see, too!

00:13:04.680 --> 00:13:06.550
Oh? What's that?

00:13:06.550 --> 00:13:08.180
Did you see something?

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:09.740
Hey! Hey!

00:13:09.740 --> 00:13:10.930
Can I...

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:13.100
Hiromi, let me see, too!

00:13:13.100 --> 00:13:15.560
Jeez, you don't stop.

00:13:16.560 --> 00:13:17.860
Let's see here...

00:13:20.900 --> 00:13:23.030
You were hogging it this whole time

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:25.450
so I can't see anything at all!

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:29.120
Boys don't whine
about the little stuff!

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:30.200
Aww...

00:13:30.580 --> 00:13:32.780
Either way he's totally late!

00:13:32.780 --> 00:13:35.500
What in the world is taking Takao so long?

00:13:35.500 --> 00:13:37.170
He's got ten minutes before

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:39.670
I make him clean toilets for the rest of his life!

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:41.090
And that's a promise!

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:42.550
Kyoujyu! Hiromi!

00:13:43.010 --> 00:13:44.260
Takao! You're late!

00:13:44.480 --> 00:13:47.800
Sorry. I was busy making these.

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:49.640
What are these?

00:13:49.640 --> 00:13:51.100
Can't you read?

00:13:51.100 --> 00:13:54.140
I was up all night making
wanted posters for Ozma!

00:13:54.140 --> 00:13:58.060
I thought I'd post these all
over town and find him!

00:13:58.060 --> 00:14:00.480
I see. That's good thinking.

00:14:00.480 --> 00:14:01.820
Right?

00:14:01.820 --> 00:14:03.360
Next time, revenge is mine!

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:06.240
I'll take the main street.
Kyoujyu, you go by the station.

00:14:06.240 --> 00:14:07.400
And Hiromi will--

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:08.700
No thanks.

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:09.620
--Huh?

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:12.240
I don't know what revenge you want,

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:13.870
but it's a waste of time.

00:14:13.870 --> 00:14:14.950
Waste of time?!

00:14:15.130 --> 00:14:16.660
Am I wrong?

00:14:16.660 --> 00:14:20.600
We've got an international crime ring
gunning for world domination!

00:14:20.600 --> 00:14:23.920
We don't have to time to be
handing out wanted posters.

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:26.590
There you go again.

00:14:26.590 --> 00:14:30.180
What kinda international crime ring is this supposed to be anyway?

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:33.140
They're the ones who kidnapped us!

00:14:33.140 --> 00:14:35.180
Are you for real?

00:14:35.180 --> 00:14:36.810
Are you seriously spouting that crap?

00:14:36.810 --> 00:14:37.980
Of course I am.

00:14:37.980 --> 00:14:42.060
If we let this go, then the future of
humanity will forever be shrouded in--

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:46.740
Wake up and smell the coffee!

00:14:46.960 --> 00:14:48.860
There's no way that'd happen!

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:50.570
It's totally dumb!

00:14:53.240 --> 00:14:54.200
Takao!

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:56.160
Cut it out, guys!

00:14:56.380 --> 00:14:58.000
How about this?

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:01.040
Today we'll hand out Takao's wanted posters,

00:15:01.040 --> 00:15:04.800
and tomorrow we'll investigate
this international crime ring!

00:15:04.800 --> 00:15:06.800
--Why do I have to do that?
--Why do I have to do that?

00:15:07.510 --> 00:15:08.800
Okay?

00:15:08.800 --> 00:15:12.850
Both of these things are related to
Takao's Sacred Beast being targeted!

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:16.390
We can't ignore the possibility
that they might be related!

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:21.310
That's why we shouldn't
waste time arguing over this!

00:15:21.310 --> 00:15:23.730
Okay? Please understand you guys.

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:35.950
What do you think
you're doing, you jerk!

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:37.240
What's your problem?!

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:40.960
You're not gonna
get away with this!

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:42.590
Who are you?

00:15:42.590 --> 00:15:44.880
Lay off, Takao.

00:15:44.880 --> 00:15:47.360
I don't think you
should mess with him.

00:15:47.360 --> 00:15:49.810
I'm not gonna take
this sitting down!

00:15:49.810 --> 00:15:52.050
I worked my butt
off to make those...

00:15:52.050 --> 00:15:53.720
Hey! Are you listening?

00:15:56.760 --> 00:15:58.100
Get back here!

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:11.950
I get it. Is that your game?

00:16:11.950 --> 00:16:13.660
I'll take you on!

00:16:13.660 --> 00:16:15.550
Stop, Takao!

00:16:15.550 --> 00:16:17.240
Stand back, Hiromi.

00:16:17.620 --> 00:16:20.080
Dragoon's gonna teach you a lesson!

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:25.790
Kyoujyu, do something!

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:28.710
Didn't you see his move just now?

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:32.050
No ordinary Blader could pull that off.

00:16:32.050 --> 00:16:34.890
This battle is potentially interesting.

00:16:34.890 --> 00:16:36.680
But why?

00:16:36.680 --> 00:16:38.890
Ready when you are!

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:43.600
I'm gonna film every second!

00:16:45.310 --> 00:16:46.560
Go Shoot!

00:16:52.280 --> 00:16:53.320
What?!

00:16:56.110 --> 00:16:59.280
Wow! It's evenly matched with Dragoon!

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:01.410
Dragoon, don't lose to him!

00:17:04.330 --> 00:17:05.540
Dragoon!

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:13.090
I can't believe it knocked back Dragoon!

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:15.010
You've got moves, do ya?

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:17.220
That's not gonna work!

00:17:17.220 --> 00:17:18.600
Go, Dragoon!

00:17:26.650 --> 00:17:27.900
--Takao!

00:17:31.280 --> 00:17:32.690
It's so fast!

00:17:32.690 --> 00:17:34.320
I can't keep up!

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:38.780
Dragoon!

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:50.170
What's that top doing?

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:51.550
Bizarre...

00:17:51.550 --> 00:17:55.470
How can it change directions so quickly?

00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:58.010
The laws of physics
don't work like that!

00:18:00.010 --> 00:18:02.510
Kyoujyu, do something!

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:03.810
I can't just...

00:18:03.810 --> 00:18:05.680
Oh? What's this?

00:18:05.840 --> 00:18:07.950
This is a magnetic field!

00:18:07.950 --> 00:18:11.730
That Bey is emitting
strong magnetic forces!

00:18:11.730 --> 00:18:12.940
Magnetic?

00:18:13.530 --> 00:18:16.580
Why is something like
that coming from a top?

00:18:16.580 --> 00:18:18.320
I don't know.

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:22.240
But I'm sure it's related to
those super fast movements.

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:25.290
Takao! Your Sacred Beast!
Summon your Sacred Beast!

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:27.370
Easier said than done!

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:33.590
You're through!

00:18:43.260 --> 00:18:44.540
He's gonna lose!

00:18:44.540 --> 00:18:46.560
Shoot! What do I do?

00:18:46.560 --> 00:18:47.730
Attack.

00:18:49.390 --> 00:18:50.350
Kai...!

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:53.610
Don't forget how you battle, Takao Kinomiya.

00:18:57.780 --> 00:18:59.860
Go, Dragoon!

00:19:05.490 --> 00:19:07.500
I'll attack, attack, and attack!

00:19:07.500 --> 00:19:09.620
I'll show you how I battle!

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:11.670
Go, Dragoon!

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:24.220
There it is!

00:19:27.180 --> 00:19:28.390
What is that?

00:19:29.430 --> 00:19:31.310
It's his Sacred Beast!

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:34.560
Sacred Beast? That's his Sacred Beast?

00:19:57.130 --> 00:19:59.210
Darn it! I won't lose!

00:20:06.260 --> 00:20:09.180
I will never lose!!

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:15.020
Dragoon, now!

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:20.900
Go!!

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:35.960
He did it! He won!

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:37.960
Yes, he certainly did!

00:20:42.380 --> 00:20:44.130
We did it, Dragoon.

00:20:52.350 --> 00:20:55.480
I taped every frame, Mr. Gideon!

00:20:55.480 --> 00:20:56.940
Well done.

00:20:56.940 --> 00:21:00.190
What shall we do with Snake?

00:21:00.650 --> 00:21:02.440
Do with him what you please.

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:05.410
We have no need for him
now that we've collected data.

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:06.450
Yes, sir.

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:19.840
Ozma... so he's Kinomiya, huh?

00:21:20.460 --> 00:21:22.550
There you are, Dunga.

00:21:22.550 --> 00:21:24.880
He's not half bad.

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:26.300
You could say that.

00:22:59.900 --> 00:23:02.360
To our surprise, the group with
the invisible Sacred Beasts

00:23:02.360 --> 00:23:04.610
came to challenge us to a battle!

00:23:04.610 --> 00:23:08.680
Hiromi gets the idea that
Kai could be an enemy spy...!

00:23:08.680 --> 00:23:10.950
That's completely ridiculous!

00:23:10.950 --> 00:23:13.870
If Kai's a spy then everything
we've known is a lie!

00:23:14.660 --> 00:23:17.500
Will we never learn, Chairman?!

00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:19.710
Anyway, watch again next week!
